{"type": "vertex_text", "round": 1, "text": "I have completed a full source-fidelity review of the entire patent application draft, including all claims, the detailed description, the abstract, the summary, the figure briefs, and the numeral list. Every technical feature, limitation, and relationship in the draft has been traced to an affirmative statement in the inventor's disclosure materials (`input/disclosure.md` and `input/conversation.md`). The review also confirmed internal consistency between the different sections of the application. One inconsistency was found between the flowchart described for FIG. 4 and the corresponding process described in the text and claims. The flowchart diagram as described simplifies a multi-step conditional process into a single decision point, which is inconsistent with the more detailed and accurate description of that same process elsewhere in the document. Other than this finding, the application draft is source-faithful and internally consistent."}
